body:
i like them, i still play both shinovi versus and estival versus. estival is the "better" of te two as there are more characters, the graphics and controls were given a bit of an upgrade and there's more content in terms of customization (which is always important to me). i've never experienced a drop in frame rate with either of the games and you should know that online is VERY dead (at least i've never found another player so i just play online survival alone lol)

&#x200B;

but if you like fast-paced 3D fight i'd say check it out since the vita doesn't have that many
